# Route: guide 31 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 52 to
# 54, 38 quests, 3.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Swamp of Sorrows, Blasted Lands, Stranglethorn Vale, Tirisfal
# Glades, Alterac Mountains, Hillsbrad Foothills): Felpaw Village -> Emerald
# Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Deadwood Village ->
# Felpaw Village -> Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Ruins of Constellas ->
# Jaedenar -> Shatter Scar Vale -> Talonbranch Glade -> Felpaw Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Crown of Will (518; Crushridge
# Mauler 36-37); The Crown of Will (519; Targ 41, Muckrake 40, Glommus 39).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 4109 Salve via
# Mining; 4110 Salve via Gathering; 4111 Salve via Skinning; 4112 Salve via
# Disenchanting; 5888 Salve via Mining; 5889 Salve via Gathering; 5890 Salve
# via Skinning; 5891 Salve via Disenchanting; 6032 Sacred Cloth.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The
# Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of
# Lordaeron (95204), Unending Torment (97288), Heart of Disruption (96984),
# The Grave Knight (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987), The Grave Knight
# (96986).

